{
  "id": "08-nyc-311-analysis",
  "title": "A year of New York's 311 requests",
  "duration": 42.8373,
  "beats": [
    {
      "text": "I queried a year of New York's three one one requests. Almost four million records.",
      "asset": "nyc-total",
      "device": "tile",
      "key": "3,963,898",
      "start": 0.0,
      "end": 4.8533,
      "voice_end": 4.6933
    },
    {
      "text": "The window is October first, twenty twenty five, through September thirtieth, twenty twenty six.",
      "asset": "nyc-total",
      "device": "focus",
      "start": 4.8533,
      "end": 10.3467,
      "voice_end": 10.1867
    },
    {
      "text": "The biggest category is illegal parking. Six hundred eleven thousand, two hundred eighty two requests.",
      "asset": "nyc-categories",
      "device": "focus",
      "key": "611,282",
      "start": 10.3467,
      "end": 16.4587,
      "voice_end": 16.2987
    },
    {
      "text": "Residential noise is next, with more than four hundred thirty two thousand requests.",
      "asset": "nyc-categories",
      "device": "sequence",
      "start": 16.4587,
      "end": 21.184,
      "voice_end": 21.024
    },
    {
      "text": "Those residential noise requests peak in the ten p m hour. Sunday is the busiest day.",
      "asset": "nyc-hours",
      "device": "focus",
      "key": "10 p.m.",
      "start": 21.184,
      "end": 26.4853,
      "voice_end": 26.3253
    },
    {
      "text": "Heat and hot water requests show a different pattern. January is far busier than August.",
      "asset": "nyc-heat",
      "device": "sequence",
      "start": 26.4853,
      "end": 31.7013,
      "voice_end": 31.5413
    },
    {
      "text": "At the other end of the list, exactly one request is filed under trapping pigeon.",
      "asset": "nyc-rare",
      "device": "focus",
      "key": "Trapping Pigeon",
      "start": 31.7013,
      "end": 36.1707,
      "voice_end": 36.0107
    },
    {
      "text": "These are request counts, not unique incidents. The queries and results are saved so you can reproduce the charts.",
      "asset": "nyc-categories",
      "device": "focus",
      "start": 36.1707,
      "end": 42.8373,
      "voice_end": 42.6773
    }
  ],
